2021-05-29 23.06.46.png", "id": "873940063188913", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974479_873940066522246_2661076465911733640_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VntyKPSshW8Q7kNvwFGYrRt&_nc_oc=AdlNMdxU7HCrH8kyMwcqiPFAIWzJtZCTDi68PbBabHTwGbKWJQy-I18o-mqAh3Lg1uk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfspLSTm2IWSQxko5gNTXGugsBdLjJj-nAAU6f4Iwy6a3Q&oe=69A2E01A"}, "display_name": "Playing VR with Girl Friend", "keywords": [], "long_description": "[Description]\nEnjoy the conversation with your girl friend!\nThis is a strategy game.\nPlace the units in the map using your hand.\nDestory the enemy's Base to win!\nDefeat the enemies before they destroy your Base.\n\n[How to Play]\nUse your hand or a controller to play!\nPress the button, pick up the units and release them in the map!\nThe left and right sticks allow you to move the user's position slightly.\n\n[Type of Units]\n-Base\nThis is the Base.\nBuild your Base stronger!!\n\n-Fighter\nA common flying unit.\nGround & Air Attack.\n\n-Factory\nA factory unit.\nIt generates cash.\n\n-Bomber\nA flying unit skilled for\nbombing and ground attack.\n\n-Tank\nAn anti-ground unit.\nAttacks with rapid fire.\n\n-Anti-aircraft Artillery\nA placement unit using missles.\nEffective to flying units.\n\n-Sheild\nA placement unit for defense.\nIt has high durability.\n", "short_description": "Let's play a VR video game with your girl friend!\nThis time it's a strategy game.\nPick up the units and release them in the map.\nThe units will start fighting automatically."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "PdpArt_3000x900_JP.png", "id": "266102791924715", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974650_266102795258048_1135847423250422851_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VM24sy7Yg4YQ7kNvwFbm6Oc&_nc_oc=AdmT0kZUw7d0fEEB982IoKcT6DHg_jYCP_d8yd2ydmSWGtfzWducciWNFswsEfFJeu4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=